      "path": "src/lib/server/accounts/repository.ts",
      "line": 78,
      "endLine": 80,
      "title": "Keep disable/enable identity and profile writes in one atomic batch",
      "description": "setDisabled commits the disabled flag with executeTakeFirst before updating profile.updated_at. If an operator profile update rejects, the request reports an error but the account flag has already changed. Source updates disabled and updated_at in a single users UPDATE (disable also uses withTransaction), so the same rejected update preserves all prior user bytes. Use the existing canonical atomicBatch for both physical writes while preserving the self/last-admin checks, affected-row guard and exact error messages.",
      "sourceProof": [
        "packages/auth/src/adapters/kysely.ts:155-168",
        "packages/core/src/astro/routes/api/admin/users/[id]/disable.ts:49-57",
